<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">JL-056 · ¥19.9</div>
  <h1>JL-056 蒜香酱油酱</h1>
  <div class="sub">韩式炸鸡酱 · 摆摊 ✅ 炸鸡店 ✅ 家庭 ✅</div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>低门槛</span>
    <span>高复购</span>
    <span>伴手</span>
    <span>适合搭配炸鸡</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐 ★★★★★</span>
  <span class="level-item med">新手可做</span>
  <span class="level-item med">回本快</span>
  <span class="level-item med">利润稳</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    广州天河有个韩国人开的炸鸡店，店面不大但每天排队。他家最火的口味是蒜香酱油——那种蒜香不是炒菜的那种熟蒜味，而是蒜经过酱油和糖稀熬煮后产生的一种复合香味。我在门口站了半小时，数了一下——十个客人里至少六个点蒜香酱油味的。<br><br>
    和老板聊了一下才知道，韩国蒜香酱油炸鸡在当地是很经典的吃法，但在国内做的人不多——大家一窝蜂做甜辣，反而把蒜香酱油这个味给忽略了。老板说酱油和蒜的比例特别重要，酱油太多咸、蒜太多冲，只有找到中间那个平衡点，才能做出那种「闻着香到不行，吃起来停不下来」的效果。<br><br>
    <em>蒜香酱油炸鸡的独特之处在于「用咸香征服味蕾」——不靠糖不靠辣，纯粹用蒜的辛香和酱油的酱香来刺激食欲。很多吃腻了甜辣口味的人，一吃蒜香酱油就被圈粉了。而且这酱不光能蘸炸鸡，拌面、拌饭、蘸饺子都行，实用性极强。</em>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">轻资产</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">投入约250元</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">★★☆☆☆</div><div class="desc">1天学会</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">★★★★☆</div><div class="desc">60%毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">吃了就忘不了</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价（100g/份）</span><span class="v">10元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本（批量熬制）</span><span class="v">约4元/份</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单份利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">约6元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销30份日利润</span><span class="v">180元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销50份日利润</span><span class="v">300元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销80份日利润</span><span class="v">480元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>月固定开销</span><span class="v">约300元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约250元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">3天</div><div>日销30份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">2天</div><div>日销50份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">1天</div><div>日销80份</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>保存期限</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">冷藏15天，需密封</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>蒜味接受度</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">有些人受不了蒜味</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>竞争</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">超市蒜香酱品种多</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>口味偏差</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">蒜和酱油比例难掌握</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
    <span>不锈钢锅（小号）60元</span>
    <span>密封罐（10个）40元</span>
    <span>电子秤 30元</span>
    <span>硅胶刮刀 15元</span>
    <span>捣蒜器 20元</span>
    <span>标签贴纸 10元</span>
    <span>一次性酱料杯 0.3元/个</span>
    <span>不锈钢打蛋器 15元</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44">
    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约250元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>1m台面</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>1天</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid">
    <span class="scene-item">炸鸡摊</span>
    <span class="scene-item">韩式料理店</span>
    <span class="scene-item">中式快餐</span>
    <span class="scene-item">家庭厨房</span>
    <span class="scene-item">外卖档口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">夜宵排档</span>
    <span class="scene-item">面馆配酱</span>
    <span class="scene-item">饺子店</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">搭配销售</div>
  <div class="dpair">
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">蒜香酱油炸鸡</div><div class="price">15-20元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">炸鸡腿</div><div class="price">12-18元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">拌面</div><div class="price">8元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">煎饺</div><div class="price">10元/份</div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:6px">蒜香酱油酱除了配炸鸡，拌面蘸饺子也是一绝，拓宽了销售场景</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">对标项目 & 竞争优势</div>
  <div class="comp">
    <div class="comp-item"><span>超市蒜香酱油</span><span class="tag adv">现熬工艺</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">超市酱大蒜味淡，且防腐剂多</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>其他摊位蒜蓉酱</span><span class="tag adv">甜酱油基底</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">别人的蒜蓉酱偏油腻</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>预制料包</span><span class="tag adv">现熬蒜香</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">预制包蒜味都是大蒜粉调的</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">销售话术</div>
  <div class="copy-box">
    「哥，试试蒜香酱油的？<em>这个味比甜辣的有层次多了</em>。」<br>
    「蒜是我自己剁的，酱油和糖熬出来的，闻着香吃着不腻。」<br>
    「韩国本地炸鸡最经典的口味就是蒜香酱油，国内反而少见。」<br>
    「来份蒜香炸鸡套餐？鸡+酱+小食一共16块，这个酱还能拌面。」<br>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">避坑指南</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 蒜泥必须用刀剁，不能用蒜蓉机打——蒜蓉机打出来的蒜泥出水太多，蒜味被水稀释了。刀剁的蒜泥颗粒感好，炒出来蒜香味更浓</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 酱油和大蒜的比例不能反——很多人觉得蒜香酱就得多放蒜，结果做出来蒜味冲得盖住了酱油味。每100克酱油配30克蒜泥，蒜是配角不是主角</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 糖稀不能少——糖稀在这里的作用不是甜，而是让蒜和酱油的味道「融合」。没有糖稀的黏稠度，蒜和酱油各管各的，吃在嘴里是分离的味道</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 炒蒜时油温不能高——蒜泥下锅时油温不能超过120℃，否则蒜会迅速焦化变黑，产生苦味。小火慢炒到蒜泥变透明就可以了</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 熬好后要过滤——蒜泥在酱中时间长了会继续释放蒜味，酱会越来越辣。建议熬好后用细筛过滤掉蒜渣，只留蒜香酱油，口感更细腻</div>
</div>

<div class="pay">
  <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
  <h3>¥19.9 解锁完整方案</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>完整配方（10倍摆摊量：酱油+蒜+糖稀黄金比例）</li>
    <li>熬制工艺标准（油温、炒蒜时间、火候控制）</li>
    <li>商用精准配比（从1份到100份的精确配比）</li>
    <li>炸鸡搭配方案（蒜香酱油炸鸡全套出品流程）</li>
    <li>保存与包装方案（密封罐+标签+15天冷藏）</li>
    <li>利润算盘（三档销量都算清了）</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="price-tag">¥19.9 <small>一次付费，永久查看</small></div>
  <a class="btn" href="#wechatSection" onclick="window.parent.scrollToWechat && window.parent.scrollToWechat()">📱 加微信购买</a>
  <div class="note">付款后微信发送完整文件</div>
</div>

<div class="ftr">沧林食品 · 食品创业决策系统</div>
</div>
